<title>CHINA: Tian An China says placement completed.</title>
<headline>Tian An China says placement completed.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tian An China Investments Co Ltd said on Thursday it had completed the placement of 170 million new shares or 8.81 percent of its enlarged share capital to Fujian Enterprises (Holdings) Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Shareholding of its controlling shareholder Sun Hung Kai &amp; Co Ltd in Tian An China was diluted to 35.84 percent from 39.30 percent, it said.</p>
<p>Tian An China had said earlier it would place the new shares to third party investor Fujian Enterprises at HK$1.08 each.</p>
<p>The company shares gained HK$0.02 to HK$1.16 on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
